NOESIS operations note
======================

This file intentionally contains no credentials.

Runtime secrets belong in a local `.env` file or a deployment secret manager.
Credentials that were previously stored here must be considered exposed and
rotated before production use.

Layer order:

core models and config
-> infrastructure utilities, logging, errors, storage
-> integrations and clients
-> cognition and memory
-> host services and workers
-> API and platform adapters
-> runner
